# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libxml2
pkgver=2.14.3
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="XML parsing (labwc reads its settings with it)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2"
license=(MIT)
depends=(glibc zlib xz)
source=("https://download.gnome.org/sources/libxml2/2.14/libxml2-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    cd libxml2-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-static --without-python --with-history
    make
}

package() {
    cd libxml2-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
